# Equity Placard Watchlist Skill (skill-equity-placard-watchlist)

当用户想知道某只/全市场 A 股谁在举牌、举到第几档、是财务投资还是谋求控制权、哪些股东已逼近 5% 举牌线时，读取并遵循 [SKILL.md](../SKILL.md) 作为本 skill 的规范说明。
详细调用声明见 `开发产物/SKILL.md`。

Use this skill when the user asks who is placarding an A-share (crossing 5%/10%/15%/20%/25%/30% disclosure thresholds), at which tier, financial vs strategic intent, or which holders are approaching the 5% line. Read and follow [SKILL.md](../SKILL.md) as the canonical
instructions; the detailed agent-facing declaration lives in `开发产物/SKILL.md`.

## Workflow

1. Read `SKILL.md`, then `开发产物/SKILL.md`.
2. Read the references before changing any data logic:
- `开发产物/references/api_guide.md`
- `开发产物/references/quality_evidence.md`
3. Run the entrypoints from the repository root:

```bash
python 开发产物/scripts/build.py --mode scan --start 20250101 --end 20260721 --save --html board.html
python 开发产物/scripts/build.py --symbols 601005.SH 002011.SZ --start 20240101 --end 20260721
python 开发产物/scripts/test.py
```

## Hard rules / 硬性口径

1. 只取 `stock_type='total'` 行计算持股比例；`flow` 行是流通股本口径，会把举牌梯度整个算错
2. 股本变动导致的被动稀释不是减持：必须先按 (票, 报告期) 推断股本变动系数，只认交易造成的越线
3. 结论口径是报告期快照重建、非实时播报；一致行动人无法合并；输出中保留这些限制

1. Use only `stock_type='total'` rows for holding ratios; `flow` rows are on float-share basis and corrupt the tier ladder
2. Passive dilution from share issuance is not a sell-down: infer the share-change factor per (symbol, report period) first and only count trade-driven crossings
3. Results are report-period snapshot reconstructions, not real-time alerts; acting-in-concert parties cannot be merged; keep these limits in the output

